1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:02,620
(Penny:)Okay. How do you know he said that?
You left the room.

2
00:00:02,787 --> 00:00:06,337
(Leonard:)Hey, do you want me to finish
working on your man-feet or not?

3
00:00:07,584 --> 00:00:09,334
(Penny:)Fine. Go ahead.

4
00:00:09,961 --> 00:00:13,461
WOMAN:
Howard, are you having a playdate?!

5
00:00:13,632 --> 00:00:16,802
(Past Howard:)I don't have playdates! I have colleagues!

6
00:00:16,968 --> 00:00:20,388
Do their parents know they're here?!

7
00:00:21,097 --> 00:00:24,307
(Past Howard:)No, but if you keep screaming,
maybe they'll hear you!

8
00:00:29,272 --> 00:00:30,312
(Past Leonard:)That your dad?

9
00:00:32,859 --> 00:00:35,649
(Past Howard:)She grows any more hair on her face, yes.

10
00:00:37,405 --> 00:00:40,115
(Past Leonard:)Oh, man. Is that a two-stage rocket?

11
00:00:40,283 --> 00:00:43,033
(Past Howard:)Three. I designed the engine myself.

12
00:00:43,203 --> 00:00:45,163
(Past Raj:)Cool. Can it break Mach 1?

13
00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:48,250
(Past Howard:)Oh, probably, if I could get
my hands on that new fuel...

14
00:00:48,416 --> 00:00:50,126
(Past Howard:)...the government's been working on.

15
00:00:50,293 --> 00:00:52,123
(Past Leonard:)Oh, this just might be your lucky day.

16
00:00:52,295 --> 00:00:58,025
WOMAN: Howard, what happened to
the Oreos I left on the counter?!

